{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "4873aa68-7f12-46e5-9805-dc981e57fb3d", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:50:46.914000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "我们新增了clk的驱动，想把它的初始化添加到boot里。\n结果一调用系统就崩溃\n\n- Boot to C runtime for OS Initialize\nReset board on recursive assert:\n（后面的dump省略）\n\n我知道放到board_late_init就没问题了。但是真的应该放在late init吗？似乎语义不太符合。请你调查一下为什么放在chip boot里会崩溃，如何解决"}
