{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "4873aa68-7f12-46e5-9805-dc981e57fb3d", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:50:46.914000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "---\n\n总结一下：**崩溃原因是 `clk_register()` 通过 `kmm_zalloc` 分配内存，但 `arm64_chip_boot()` 执行时内核堆（`kmm_initialize`）尚未初始化。放在 `board_late_initialize` 中是正确做法——它是 NuttX 中\"OS 就绪后、驱动初始化前\"的标准钩子，完全符合语义。**"}
